<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's Inapa boosts H1 profit.</title>
<headline>Portugal's Inapa boosts H1 profit.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ending June 30</p>
<p>(In billions of escudos unless stated)</p>
<p>    Cons net profit	 0.40    vs    0.30</p>
<p>    Turnover		 23.50    vs   25.70</p>
<p>NOTE - Inapa-Investimento chairman Vasco Pessanha told Reuters the papermaker expected to end the year with a consolidated net profit of one billion escudos against 351 million last year. Pessanha forecast sales of between 45 and 50 billion escudos against 49.5 billion in 1995.</p>
<p>He said the decline in sales over the first half reflected price movements in volume terms. Turnover rose 10 percent to 87,000 tonnes.</p>
<p>($1=154.37 escudos)</p>
<p>--Jose Barata, Lisbon bureau 3511-3113121</p>
